{"unit":6,"no":24,"title":"Your town, your home, your food","blurb":"★ Review 2","VOCAB":[["library","","библиотека","кітапхана",""],["chemist's","","аптека","дәріхана",""],["armchair","","кресло","кресло",""],["shelf","","полка","сөре",""],["noisy","","шумный","шулы",""],["rent","","снимать жильё","жалға алу",""],["turn left","","поверните налево","солға бұрылыңыз",""],["go straight on","","идите прямо","тура жүріңіз",""],["jumper","","свитер","жемпір",""],["trousers","","брюки","шалбар",""],["boil","","варить","қайнату",""],["chop","","нарезать","турау",""]],"SLIDES":[],"PICWORDS":["library","chemist's","armchair","shelf","noisy","rent","turn left","go straight on","jumper","trousers","boil","chop"],"DEFS":[],"CTX":{},"COLLOC":{},"IMG":{},"NOTES":{},"TIMING":{},"tracks":{"4_13":"A1_L24_4_13.mp3","4_2":"A1_L24_4_2.mp3","4_10":"A1_L24_4_10.mp3","9_17":"A1_L24_9_17.mp3"},"SEGS":{"4_13":[3.45,null],"4_2":[3.31,null],"4_10":[4.83,null],"9_17":[3.67,null]},"html":"\n  <section class=\"stage on\" data-stage=\"Intro\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 1 &middot; Intro</div>\n      <h2>Your town, your home, your food</h2>\n      <p>Put Units 4–6 together: show a visitor around, describe your home — then order a meal.</p>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How to study</b> — about 25 minutes. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>Headphones on. This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after the review.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with a partner. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after class.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>How this lesson works</b> — you work with your teacher. Nothing new today — everything is review.</div><div>This lesson has real audio — tap ▶ to listen together.</div><div>If a task is hard, go back to that lesson after class.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Riddles\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 2 &middot; Riddles</div>\n      <h2>Riddles</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">The riddle game — you know these places.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen and choose. Fast!</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_13',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.13 — seven riddles</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">1 You go here when you are ill. 2 You can study here or take books home. 3 You can see a film here. 4 You usually need your passport to travel from here. 5 You can sleep here on holiday. 6 You can go here to have dinner. 7 There's lots of water and you can swim here.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s1t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">3 — You can see a film here.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a library</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a cinema</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an library</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">6 — You can go here to have dinner.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a hospital</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a restaurant</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an restaurant</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">7 — Lots of water — you can swim here.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">an airport</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a swimming pool</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">an swimming pool</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>cinema · restaurant · swimming pool — Unit 4 words, still warm.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Words\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 3 &middot; Words</div>\n      <h2>Words</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"vbar\">\n        <div class=\"instruction\" style=\"margin:0\">Read the words. Click a card to see an example.</div>\n        <label class=\"switch\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"trToggle\"><span class=\"track\"></span><span>Show translation</span></label>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"words\" id=\"words\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">First — the key words of these units. Save the ones you want to keep.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Then: one word doesn't belong — choose it.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s2t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">library · chemist · museum · fridge\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">library</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">fridge</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">museum</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">sofa · armchair · shelf · airport\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sofa</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">airport</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">shelf</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">grilled · baked · fried · noisy\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">grilled</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">noisy</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">baked</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">turn left · go past · straight on · starter\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">starter</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">turn left</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">go past</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">jumper · trousers · scarf · saucepan\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">jumper</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">saucepan</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">scarf</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">boil · chop · mix · rent\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">boil</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">rent</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">chop</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>fridge = kitchen (others: places) · airport = place (others: furniture) · noisy is not a cooking style · starter is not a direction · saucepan is not clothes · rent is not cooking.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Grammar\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 4 &middot; Grammar</div>\n      <h2>Grammar</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Everything from Units 4–6. Choose the correct form.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s3t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ a park near my house.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There's</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There are</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">It is</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There aren't ___ theatres in my town.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">any</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">some</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">I live in ___ flat. ___ flat is small.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">a / The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the / A</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a / A</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">___ the button twice. (instruction)\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">You press</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Press</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Pressing</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">In 1990 you ___ shop online.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">can't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">don't</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">couldn't</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">Look! It ___!\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">is raining</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">rains</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">are raining</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">7</span><span class=\"body\">I usually ___ tea, but today I'm drinking coffee.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">am drinking</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">a / The</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">drink</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">8</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ rice do we need?\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">many</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">much</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">a lot</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>there's/any · a→the · imperatives · could · now → -ing · usually → Simple · rice → much.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Clinic\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 5 &middot; Clinic</div>\n      <h2>Clinic</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Six classic mistakes from Units 4–6. Choose the correct sentence.</div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s4t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “There is many cafés here.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">There is a lot of café here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">There is a lot of cafés here.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">There are a lot of cafés here.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I live in the Almaty.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I live at the Almaty.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Don't open the window.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I live in Almaty.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “Don't to open the window.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">No open the window.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">Don't open the window.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">Nos open the window.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I can to swim.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I can swimming.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I cans swimming.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I can swim.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">5</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “I'm knowing the answer.”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">I knowing the answer.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">I know the answer.</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I knows the answer.</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">6</span><span class=\"body\">❌ “How much carrots do we need?”\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">How many carrots do we need?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">How much carrot do we need?</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">I live in Almaty.</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>a lot of cafés · no article with cities · Don't + base · can + base · know = state verb · carrots → many.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Hotel\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 6 &middot; Hotel</div>\n      <h2>Hotel</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">A hot tourist arrives at a hotel in Coober Pedy.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then choose True or False.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_2',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.2 — is there a swimming pool?</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">F: I'm so hot! I'm so happy to be at the hotel at last. Is there a swimming pool? R: No, I'm sorry, there isn't. It doesn't rain a lot here, so there aren't many swimming pools. There's a big swimming pool in the town centre if you want to go swimming. F: Are there any museums near the centre? R: Yes, there are. There's the opal mine museum. A: And are there any underground buildings we can visit? R: Yes, there are lots of beautiful underground buildings in Coober Pedy. They aren't very far from the hotel, so you can walk to most of them. A: And is there a theatre in Coober Pedy? R: No, there aren't any theatres here, I'm afraid. But there is a cinema just near the hotel.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s5t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">There's a swimming pool at the hotel.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">There's a big pool in the town centre.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">There are some underground buildings to visit.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">True</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">False</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">4</span><span class=\"body\">There's a theatre in Coober Pedy.\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">False</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">True</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>No pool at the hotel (but one in the centre) · underground buildings yes · theatres no, cinema yes.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"The way\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 7 &middot; The way</div>\n      <h2>The way</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">The way to the chemist — do you still remember it?</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('4_10',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 4.10 — street directions</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">S: Excuse me, could you give me some directions, please? A: Yes, of course! S: Is there a chemist near here? A: Yes, there is. It's in the town centre. Go out of the main door and turn left. Then go to the end of the road and turn left again. Go straight on for about five minutes. Go past the internet café and the bank, and then turn left into Raya Andong. It's on the left, next to the supermarket. S: OK, thanks. Oh, and where's the palace? A: It's at the end of this road on the corner. Here, take one of these maps.</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s6t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Go out of the main door and…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">turn left</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">turn right</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">turn lefts</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Go past…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"b\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the school and the park</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the internet café and the bank</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">turn left</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">The chemist is next to…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the supermarket</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">the palace</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the palaces</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Left · past the internet café and the bank · next to the supermarket.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Dinner\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 8 &middot; Dinner</div>\n      <h2>Dinner</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">And to finish — dinner.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Listen once. Then answer.</p>\n      <div class=\"player\">\n        <button class=\"btn btn-audio segbtn\" onclick=\"playTrack('9_17',this)\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg> Play</button>\n        <div class=\"wave\"></div>\n        <div class=\"meta\"><b>Track 9.17 — ordering dinner</b>Original coursebook recording</div>\n      </div>\n      <details class=\"gref\" style=\"margin-top:16px\"><summary>Show transcript</summary><div class=\"gref-body\">W: Would you like to order? S: Yes, please. Just a main course — could I have the grilled chicken? W: And would you like any side dishes? S: Can I have some roast potatoes and some mixed green vegetables, please? W: And for you, madam? M: Could I have some fish cakes, please? And a tomato, olive and onion salad. W: Would you like something to drink? M: Some sparkling water, please. S: The same for me. Can we pay by credit card? W: Yes, of course!</div></details>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s7t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">The man orders…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"c\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">the fish cakes</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">roast potatoes and green vegetables</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the grilled chicken</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">His side dishes are…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">roast potatoes and green vegetables</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">chips and rice</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the grilled chicken</button></div></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">They both drink…\n          <div class=\"opts\" data-correct=\"a\"><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"a\">sparkling water</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"b\">apple juice</button><button class=\"opt\" data-val=\"c\">the grilled chicken</button></div></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Grilled chicken · roast potatoes + mixed green vegetables · sparkling water for both.</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Write\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 9 &middot; Write</div>\n      <h2>Write</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"self\">A friend from another country visits you for one day. Write the plan.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"self\">6–8 sentences: your area, your home, directions, and dinner.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"self\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>In my neighbourhood there's…</li><li>There are some…</li><li>From the bus stop, turn…</li><li>My flat is on the … floor</li><li>Let's eat at… — it has…</li><li>Could we have the…, please?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"group\">A visitor for one day — three scenes.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"group\">Student A is the visitor, Student B is the local. Then swap.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>Is there a … near here?</li><li>How do I get to…?</li><li>Turn left at the…</li><li>There's a place called…</li><li>Could I have…, please?</li><li>Could we have the bill?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"instruction\" data-only=\"solo\">A visitor for one day — three scenes.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\" data-only=\"solo\">Student A is the visitor, Student B is the local. Then swap roles.</p>\n      <div class=\"bubble cy\" style=\"margin-top:20px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">Useful language</div><ul><li>Is there a … near here?</li><li>How do I get to…?</li><li>Turn left at the…</li><li>There's a place called…</li><li>Could I have…, please?</li><li>Could we have the bill?</li></ul></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"group\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Scene 1 — the area.</b> The visitor asks: Is there a…? Are there any…? The local answers about the REAL neighbourhood.</div><div><b>Scene 2 — the way.</b> The visitor asks how to get to the local's home from here. The local gives real directions.</div><div><b>Scene 3 — dinner.</b> The local recommends a real place and plays the waiter. The visitor orders a full meal and asks for the bill.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"bubble\" style=\"margin-top:18px\" data-only=\"solo\"><div class=\"blab\">In other words</div><div><b>Scene 1 — the area.</b> The visitor asks: Is there a…? Are there any…? The local answers about the REAL neighbourhood.</div><div><b>Scene 2 — the way.</b> The visitor asks how to get to the local's home from here. The local gives real directions.</div><div><b>Scene 3 — dinner.</b> The local recommends a real place and plays the waiter. The visitor orders a full meal and asks for the bill.</div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Type it\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 10 &middot; Type it</div>\n      <h2>Type it</h2>\n    </div>\n\n      <div class=\"instruction\">Now produce it — type, don’t tap.</div>\n      <p class=\"subline\">Spelling counts. Type the answers, then check.</p>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s9t1\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">___ two banks on this street.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Turn left \\u2014 the hotel is on ___ right.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"the\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">How ___ is the soup?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"much\" placeholder=\"Type the missing word…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: there is/are \\u00b7 turn left \\u00b7 how much/many \\u00b7 Could I have\\u2026?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s9t2\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">There is two banks.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"There are two banks.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Turn on left.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Turn left.\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">How much apples do you want?<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How many apples do you want?\" placeholder=\"Type the whole correct sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: there is/are \\u00b7 turn left \\u00b7 how much/many \\u00b7 Could I have\\u2026?</p></div>\n      <div class=\"task\" data-task data-tid=\"l24s9t3\">\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">1</span><span class=\"body\">Make a question: There is a chemist's near here.<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Is there a chemist's near here?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">2</span><span class=\"body\">Order politely: the fish<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"Could I have the fish, please?|I'd like the fish, please.|Can I have the fish, please?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <div class=\"row\"><span class=\"num\">3</span><span class=\"body\">Ask the price: these shoes<br><input class=\"gap gap-lg\" data-answer=\"How much are these shoes?\" placeholder=\"Type the new sentence…\"></span></div>\n        <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" onclick=\"check(this)\">Check answers</button>\n        <div class=\"res\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bubble am\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"blab\">Why</div><p>Review: there is/are \\u00b7 turn left \\u00b7 how much/many \\u00b7 Could I have\\u2026?</p></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"stage\" data-stage=\"Done\">\n    <div class=\"stage-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Stage 11 &middot; Done</div>\n      <h2>Done</h2>\n    </div>\n\n  </section>\n\n"}